purpose operation findChar "Walk haystack byte-by-byte; return the zero-based offset of the first match or -1 when not found. Exercises pointer.loadByte in a recursion-free loop with multiple branchIf branches sharing a single counter var."
invariant operation findChar "Stops at the first NUL terminator if no match."
label startFindChar
storage module immutable zeroPos CSignedInt64 0
storage module immutable oneStep CSignedInt64 1
storage module immutable negOneInitial CSignedInt64 -1
storage module immutable nullByte CSignedInt64 0
memory findChar mutable cursor CSignedInt64 zeroPos
